      "hash": "bc47da663d101bfc1d4edcb3762f37fbe8fab3e931cfd460c69cb432b806d419"
    },
    {
      "id": "d6a5443d827fe94c6b2c5f8a96236b50ba36a5fae08418e8377733976dc6dc0e",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "6cf24c5fecb0aef3a44ffed20ef5ca443e1c3d481f1a704038e2ab21a3af1210",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "a26a696ceebeb9bf2b1b8c9d0ded14c752c712f11edd5ed1ac0c725ec8af64e9",
      "text": "Next lesson",
      "hash": "d0ae2a13d8665949dd104a2fbdedcc8bca3e647a1e131d1ebaeb31c189a553b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "60b713f1f922df6a152f283f64119b4625eee79c2eb806fe1cb1706d7cb9c7b1",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "9660e72e57500bd84d7b3729d9baa6eaf5f68979640ba1414e27406b9f1aa17d",
      "text": "Reading From A URL",
      "hash": "019248710831e04efa175c5db64f45e5638864416e03d47d550a79544fb406fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "77490e28cf3bb0bc5cf6df7dd1c2c80fc46e3712b1e785d058d1422f1b06c17d",
      "text": "Up next",
      "hash": "e31da5b25f8b7324861e9aadaf5c503e7fd43e739fa3be17ebe63e999fb13df1"
    },
    {
      "id": "080e0d380ce18c7487060b0f92610bda4f5276adc4501ecbd42254e5a34b6e9f",
      "text": "Another thing that the AI SDK handles out of the box is passing images and files to LLMs.",
      "hash": "ae6254c65e41359aa0040058f3a63a793c9a38c42b1ce19ccc98417eb3b1b57f"
    },
    {
      "id": "93dae1e93a8a8798019a612b0120d228c997d7bba09c94dffa7d0b5862e03146",
      "text": "LLMs can then look at the file or the image and do things with it. It's an extremely powerful feature.",
      "hash": "dcf311320ff59dd5182b48ff3035a834b6611f400aee93c54094158cc0428674"
    },
    {
      "id": "72ce14fb7a967891eb8fd358173a43c737f45be685b9706ec64511e16983c55e",
      "text": "Not all LLMs support this, but for the ones that do, AI SDK also lets you do it.",
      "hash": "c6ab5e4f3a284ade2a5681af3a46eb1dadfdbefb877b9992fd8fb9c54bb0dc59"
    },
    {
      "id": "75948292790da4d907f74588477b3546622c697dfadf9797f1f6c25be571ea50",
      "text": "In this case, we want the LLM to generate some alt text for the image that we pass it.",
      "hash": "01df6daa6a190432dc74e4673e158fbce002cd861a0a813a16313e6c4c1b7e9b"
    },
    {
      "id": "5132818cf09e84dec875ede2336af110400b6e577344508716fe2da64399dd00",
      "text": "We might use this alt text on a website or something to help folks who can't actually see the image understand what's in it.",
      "hash": "654ce8b91501588dc888da0bb9f1ab1ffb1ec364db32e4e78b8e8736c43a84a4"
    },
    {
      "id": "18ced621f1e4012fb70e216920f20c8e2154e8ad7539af5b4df46676ee4428ab",
      "text": "Scrollycoding",
      "hash": "a92db14e4d481e7975b3459710fbf8ec73dcc232e366b057507f7e2891b1d6da"
    },
    {
      "id": "f35f1625f4a0c20c2cab488f4cee19fb5a444661e8df18758f0d49215fb13cd0",
      "text": "We're going to use a pretty simple system prompt:",
      "hash": "6b80e5b91433fe2606682ffc78af207424c56671615731622425b85a12469f6b"
    },
    {
      "id": "0bcbf76208cde6d7e103fc37532c8ec8fdb18f2b3e6a1f9c10737b3e7a49088b",
      "text": "Then we're going to create a function called",
      "hash": "54b7bcc8edb4dfa773f547e82bf48a73fc86e3225859ab255cb7a17cbbb374cd"
    },
    {
      "id": "086f58b250f3734caa56044e5865f13f2caebee9991eac55ac221ee4d5ea8492",
      "text": "which is going to receive a path to an image on our local file system.",
      "hash": "5c30e65e7f197ecc0bee3f70801ebd113a352275b5005a3542fc4abb8c66fef0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bb637584250815df3eda4b3dc7dd161bba61a49ffb169a55aa6502806e797c1e",
      "text": "This looks fine, but we're not yet using the",
      "hash": "4e7e6336adbe208ccd25731b50d9e316adc8bf00a4975488f02813f086907df6"
    },
    {
      "id": "fa83c8b4406a9dd41405cbdf7b3d58dfd2e53b3e8520078bc0c1a3bbba035956",
      "text": "inside our function.",
      "hash": "4ca18a7a844c7213b4f740d259cef6fc5581afe9cebcd3177e00c3b10cdad376"
    },
    {
      "id": "70ce74ace7d26c0e5b6c1e0a80b3de95ca7c26f7249170fedb16afd83fed4242",
      "text": "We can't pass the image path directly as a prompt; we first need to actually load the image into memory and then pass that into the",
      "hash": "51c30e448865cdbc5ac6d32ee9c8359dd91422489b1924f38228b0c15adaaa55"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4b30732cf73bfd5894e77418d1da2b957cbd73bc5737a6d0d1495d51af04d06",
      "text": "function.",
      "hash": "78655d4d73de012287e630a648d3bc75193043eb45bfd031f8cd041012119e1d"
    },
    {
      "id": "1262711f4eca6e26c69021dfbb45ad56ba57df52d456a8ce1eee5e3a9cde7859",
      "text": "To load it into memory, we're going to use",
      "hash": "0d7a3cb77afe33529b5b457b80f8c73e3e9e5f058f185ed43a2f8c03f803585f"
    },
    {
      "id": "a941d9d29b6ec4613216f4e8f6ba1189eee269c9c7e16b91095d7e72e0b91161",
      "text": "from Node.js.",
      "hash": "190beca1aadf48f87098edaa7567d46139aa173bf41c6c2b2c1bc8fc98670fd5"
    },
    {
      "id": "f27d49b28c2f3b65c48a8be929b3529a1f154fd7fc0139017735ac045f97eaa6",
      "text": "This stores the image in memory as a",
      "hash": "4dfcdbc2bcd658e11087208165ff1d3c9a3c5e22942978ccca6d8551242ce2ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "db5d38fcba164243181ab489470c9ed40d9ad9cf640508f20a22ad207dd98ea3",
      "text": ", essentially a raw representation of the bytes that make up the image.",
      "hash": "c8c9580b08a3a176b746d0f0d376d9234ad6db57590aeb988f9638f5423d0527"
    },
    {
      "id": "384fe62f4e8df408f5a489c9fee00d460a41c65c15cb34ac970b9041d29aafdf",
      "text": "We could, of course, use",
      "hash": "8a36b8869156bbf0f6e2514a085a3f2291dc9e18c89c68272f91d78b523e6004"
    },
    {
      "id": "eebcc5bbceb83e64b278ecd298284ec075cd4e68a48348038ecac0ac4b483129",
      "text": "if we wanted non-blocking I/O. But",
      "hash": "ac2c5523c5d8d0087feb23f034f1d06a840e93407bade85122d76deb1d021fd2"
    },
    {
      "id": "2deee2c31b3e5116bb6b1f3a8a96e24b7bf29a86cc05bf47a940117430cf33cb",
      "text": "is fine for our purposes.",
      "hash": "fb56adc6422de6b6a812b3f2891ead4c134386d81dc5d61ed5717ef446237cd0"
    },
    {
      "id": "fc5cf3dfc7c4b5a098d6afcf3102cc29f52befe1fd91adcffedfe6aac1416d6f",
      "text": "Now we can pass this",
      "hash": "0ce041d1e14a7a3623c10d5f3d585102a90307ba07ee743e498343cd67ae6c5f"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ebef24b6208a303786cccae3dfce53645c300fa53e2c719ba287b9850669073",
      "text": "into the",
      "hash": "3674fb6960c6fdbd3fdaeff18b1d910f236f90e4268c01f0ca94fd4993d3c987"
    },
    {
      "id": "d1e97391595f65443f6d09614bafaeea25ede63870810b647629497d23fdda25",
      "text": "function. But we can't just pass it in as a prompt; we need to pass it in as a",
      "hash": "b6248706e2281ca16e647279fd3473950f326aa565e7414cf85b7509b2a07f4b"
    },
    {
      "id": "36dc2240f20f72d3c464020829f9f43af966515b35aa82c481521f87ff5cb828",
      "text": "array:",
      "hash": "5402a0ec5f7d82744ad7d26531800fdada8156f8730b582bf42ee359b7110855"
    },
    {
      "id": "53ce00e12f7f9e38f9af26dcec188876c3a284bdc4f4b82e644091316295bb93",
      "text": "This is in the same format as the chat history we saw before, but this time we have",
      "hash": "f2abfe9e312734c23a4d31ec84c95c72861a42804c9c122b171fe97b58367250"
    },
    {
      "id": "adb1dfd66371912269bab4281ca2cc9e84173f2cd7cc4e200292b766f1b1aa54",
      "text": "which is an array of different message parts.",
      "hash": "57ac8f5ec43aa598695e7991ceb7756cdbe74bf89f184e726d9f6f45b60c4a3b"
    },
    {
      "id": "c318752e1e0592bf7be3e0c1fdda95ba0ead7f62d3e332a710c7a5dc8e40754d",
      "text": "The message part that we're passing is of type",
      "hash": "3a0d2a80ab4164112566157194c3070a2d13e24935af968b54a0aab262f95087"
    },
    {
      "id": "b81652f6d43f40b58b1ac3308eee1e0c95d67cd3ab0209b24750d3229c59ae9f",
      "text": ", and then we're passing the",
      "hash": "f96e74ff0a6094227363c30d718dfec96f1662b059b2cb4d7e107a56518c9e9d"
    },
    {
      "id": "f50fffd3f30657a4139ab98837980ec186e3582543b5541e63bfd0e9d785dc8c",
      "text": "property.",
      "hash": "7175742fec0f0c94cd846ee7acdbca87716ab60ff1bb6e12b208623d7d84d1a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "22cbbfc78db60ef02e22f3472cc406c2a919d7e389a74977a5953419967594b0",
      "text": "Let's try running this. I've got an image of some fireworks. Let's pass it in and see what happens.",
      "hash": "6e0e689b44387310602283c3c1c30920e28612c6e97c182c4d3318fecd22506b"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7764923ad3bf5a2a482b4fa8ab3710f887c8a180cecbc486a195b3d2e563231",
      "text": "We get back our beautiful description:",
      "hash": "7c0231c5c8f2050a97842353ad0fbfc5b71d39ae1a0c957c6e06cc119b574141"
    },
    {
      "id": "e9a8f5e094c2bb4794bf4b8078720b997e3e7fe44699c5e8c130d3e6112c9287",
      "text": "To sum up, we read an image into memory, passed it directly into",
      "hash": "4265a6a6b4396091de96cdb6de91b572a2451ea37ff7da1079098ae117189476"
    },
    {
      "id": "054257268fc50949b6c3e081925c8dedeb5c65668b5960807738cf19172d8df6",
      "text": "via the",
      "hash": "71b9bf2bd61285bebe0ceb9fd33f37ac30eb1c718b6cb5c7da2eea3b368e3f1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b814aa1d114a3fb154a94e72ec7737aeae2d3e45c082214cf19353f6c2becb71",
      "text": "array, and got back a description of that image. Pretty sweet.",
      "hash": "3da8b3e42dbd91f350f4e104fa11be3796e9f51c333072a0f43fa9defb526944"
    },
    {
      "id": "143cbcf3b7a93bca701281ebf463893bc6ccf106186f6c5f49df91d1c96bd14d",
      "text": "Our current approach works if you have the file in memory. But what if you only have a URL to the file?",
      "hash": "8dc505fe3a863528ed1b66aff366318cdd42bf7cf2018d615fc9b2f90d953ee8"
    },
    {
      "id": "573b842e71fc6df9cd58ab4c275d4975176167daa9e3a470ff74d71bf7dbb360",
      "text": "Well, there's a really nice shortcut - You can pass the URL directly to the AI SDK.",
      "hash": "fa86f72039393cfdea802a55cbefdbd0c690234e0183d14dbd1047c3932acdbb"
    },
    {
      "id": "67b4e0bdc19e46d7e4e107f02c6b5d8ad2a30c52cf4bb64a5c002e8680c553e2",
      "text": "We're wrapping the URL with",
      "hash": "625034a683d2ee5ba6543493b2cbe3cb8c5b8a0df85e93e16b884b28c49b630d"
    },
    {
      "id": "6364372963a4cf09dbe0e81edee78ccf12fc5ea947b255d3dff4f19b275629ab",
      "text": "to indicate to the AI SDK that this is a URL on the web that we want to send along to the LLM.",
      "hash": "28af3ecf14ab3c9ca9785497b5eba2897d1c81022573d2784dfb7e298b66c4b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "e9e23901ee156acc9dad3b4532dff675b7a27520a014aed52a335da5d149edce",
      "text": "Let's test it out. We've got an image of a church that we wanted to describe, that I've hosted on GitHub:",
      "hash": "45471338d1e54f89b676a63882fb75808ae2f0e736a8526745694bbe8b6ab5bd"
    },
    {
      "id": "4c7d082d85dec9c6cf8ab1097d8683606befbbbc0a1f937922e49546bc751127",
      "text": "When we run this, it's going to pass the URL to the LLM. The LLM will then download the image and have a look at it. And then we get back our description.",
      "hash": "eb3720b9a58f74c6272f3ab653a68715388f6c15cb0d2ae6c6dd458afb404899"
    },
    {
      "id": "02f8a06c150ebabf0897d619c7ce6c4c513a62dcbcff85349b75d21f4ccf0980",
      "text": "This is a really great way to take a shortcut when you're working with images hosted on the web.",
      "hash": "7ff3f6298187516e156365759311e8992fcbf874f22f4fdd8a0b73b54daa5cb2"
    },
    {
      "id": "309fe4fa8c2c0af6bc39dbe06c28db6941e662ef54d8caddfa57922afd9c2b0b",
      "text": "Share on X",
      "hash": "78d21bbf6b047944ec42890d28e151c61dbab35213fc65cc7be70c0c19c24407"
    },
    {
      "id": "f92bda2f4e1680512bd5d1a09047005f21ef59aac4802da534f64442d542f6c1",
      "text": "Share on Bluesky",
      "hash": "08863b88a05c60410c38c4caec5bc72535b0f01793ce6cee9171b6358b2c11da"
    },
    {
      "id": "28f6f4bd39a351a02aaf320a62d223bb49989d74e637a0950f22c986ae125a46",
      "text": "Share on LinkedIn",
      "hash": "ab87c050148bd1d372e3ec3483a606127a7a1faec0f1ca5543bc3465d84fe6c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "1aba61ccc1e9f8d4761ae46304dc7cb9ca4d28bd368fd38272251a4d54c14b73",
      "text": "Copy URL",
      "hash": "b26d1037f1c2da31a0296d915982f12049f91bfedb998b105ce967b73a796699"
    },
    {
      "id": "21cd5ea9dec83f02d2b822e9f417f9aacf1f580de5228d4122866ddc4b5a656e",
      "text": "Previous",
      "hash": "a57b08a480b822a0a572b993391c292ede593bf8000b406675b180bbb16260fa"
    },
